        <footnote id="F3">The options vest as follows: (i) 40,000 options vest in eight equal quarterly installments; (ii) 5,000 options vest upon completion and publication of the clinical validation study of CogniMIR(R) to meet CLIA requirements; (iii) 10,000 options vest upon the Company entering into a biopharmaceutical services, collaboration or partnership agreement resulting in proceeds to the Company of at least $250,000; (iv) 5,000 options vest upon the Company generating $1,000,000 in revenue; (v) 10,000 options vest upon completion of capital raises totaling $5,000,000; and (vi) 10,000 options vest upon a 100% increase in the Company's stock price following the closing of the merger that occurred in July 2026.</footnote>
